    "text": "newportdispatch.com\nwebsite\nConcord\n3 arrested after refusing to leave New Hampshire legislative building in Concord\nBy Daniel Duric,\n1 hours agoCONCORD — Three people were arrested June 17 after refusing to leave a committee room in the state Legislative Office Building past business hours. New Hampshire State Police said the arrests occurred just before 4:30 p.m. when troopers responded to assist the State House Security Unit at 33 N. State Street.",
